# Where to edit (uga-lit-components)

## Add new work here

- **New component:** `src/components/uga-<name>.ts` (kebab-case file name, `uga-` prefix).
- **Register in bundle:** ensure the file is picked up by `src/all.ts` (`import.meta.glob` on `src/components`).
- **Demo page:** `demo/<name>.html` and link from `index.html` / `index-all-in-one.html`.

## Do not change unless the task requires it

- **`vite.config.ts`** — single-file bundle layout (`dist/js/uga-components.js`).
- **Unrelated existing components** in `src/components/`.
- **`package.json` / lockfile** — only when adding dependencies the team approved.

## Deploy reminder

- Production bundle: `dist/js/uga-components.js` → eLC Public Files path documented in README.

